mor":"WP1014205","helmet":"WP1024505"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"百济国第十二代国王。永兴元年，汾西王被暗杀後，因契王年幼，遂由沙伴王之弟比流王嗣位。比流王死後，契王继承了王位。契王勇力过人，长於骑射。在位只有三年，期间的事迹不详。","tc":"百濟國第十二代國王。永興元年，汾西王被暗殺後，因契王年幼，遂由沙伴王之弟比流王嗣位。比流王死後，契王繼承了王位。契王勇力過人，長於騎射。在位只有三年，期間的事跡不詳。","en":"The 12th king of Baekje. In the first year of Yongxing, after King Bunseo was assassinated, King Biryu, the younger brother of King Saban, succeeded to the throne because King Gye was still young. After King Biryu died, King Gye inherited the throne. King Gye possessed extraordinary strength and was skilled in mounted archery. He reigned for only three years, and little is recorded of his deeds during his reign.","jp":"百済国の第十二代国王。永興元年、汾西王が暗殺された後、契王が幼少であったため、沙伴王の弟である比流王が王位を継いだ。比流王の死後、契王が王位を継承した。契王は勇力に優れ、騎射に長けていた。在位はわずか三年で、その間の事績は不詳である。","kr":"백제의 제12대 국왕입니다. 영흥 원년, 분서왕이 피살된 후 계왕의 나이가 어려 사반왕의 아우인 비류왕이 왕위에 올랐습니다. 비류왕이 서거한 뒤 계왕이 왕위를 계승하였습니다. 계왕은 용력이 뛰어나고 기마 사격에 능했습니다. 재위 기간은 3년에 불과하며, 그동안의 행적은 상세히 전해지지 않습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1049615","remark":"普武","surname":"","surnameTc":"","surnameEn":"","surnameJp":"","surnameKr":"","surnameOther":"","name":"契","nameTc":"契","nameEn":"Gye","nameJp":"契","nameKr":"계","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"契","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"190","city":"CS1068","gender":"0","rule":"52","force":"55","wise":"54","politics":"54","charm":"54","will":"56","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"5","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"26/29/25/24/30/54/25/27","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1013405","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"3200"